            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. Timely notice as indicated in Section B above shall impose the duty to engage in meeting and conferring for the purposes of negotiating amendments to the Articles so specified. Such negotiations shall commence on or about August 1, 2007 unless otherwise mutually agreed to by the parties.",
            "block_bbox": [
